;ci'oi:COI2 ((Phenomimes and psychomimes|Psychomemes)) (proposed by ((tijlan)).) 
Converts following cmevla or zoi-quote into psychomeme. Narrower term than ((tai'i)). See also ((BPFK Section: Case sumtcita|ci'o)), ((sa'ei)), ((ki'ai)).

* Examples in some languages. 
** jpn: そわそわ (sowasowa): restlessly.
** nep: सुखदुख (sukhadukha): lit. happiness-sorrow; the human condition.
** eng: zing

* Examples of ci'oi in use:
** ci'oi dokidokin denpa [http://www.editgrid.com/user/tijlan/%E3%83%AD%E3%82%B8%E3%83%90%E3%83%B3%E8%BE%9E%E6%9B%B8|(to xe fanva fa la tijlan zoi py ドキドキしながら待つ py toi)]
** .au mi sipna ci'oi .nemunem. [https://twitter.com/daupet3222/status/194083215911301120|(to se cusku la'o ty daupet3222 ty toi)]